WEBVTT

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:07.570
The date is 1969.

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:11.410
The place is Japan in a period
of advanced economic growth.

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:14.810
This is the story of those who protect
mankind from the grasp of invaders.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.510
This is the story
of the Gate Keepers.

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:36.070
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:46.250
<i>Chikara to chikara butsukareba,
When power collides with power,</i>

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:48.850
<i>arasoi wa hajimaru.
wars start.</i>

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:52.390
<i>Tatakau koto ga</i> yuuki <i>to</i>
I <i>don't think fighting</i>

00:00:52.390 --> 00:00:54.390
<i>omowanai kedo...
equals bravery, but...</i>

00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:56.800
<i>...mamoritai yo
...I want to protect</i>

00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:59.360
kimi <i>no sono egao.
that smile on your face.</i>

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:04.970
<i>Asu e no geeto
We can't see the gate</i>

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:07.670
<i>mienai keredo...
to tomorrow, but...</i>

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:11.440
<i>dare ni</i> demo <i>aru yo.
one's inside each of us.</i>

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:14.110
<i>Let's open the gate!</i>

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:18.820
Kinou <i>no namida</i> wa
<i>The tears we shed yesterday</i>

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:21.080
<i>kitto muda ja nai.
are probably not in vain.</i>

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:25.460
<i>Arasoi no nai</i> mirai wa
<i>A future without war</i>

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:29.220
<i>ano tobira no mukougawa.
waits behind that door.</i>

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:32.360
Mune <i>no oku</i> fukaku
<i>Retrieve the key lying</i>

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:36.300
<i>Jitto shimaikonda
deep inside your heart,</i>

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:39.100
<i>kagi wo takaku kakagete,
hold it up high,</i>

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:41.340
<i>fumidasou!
and step out!</i>

00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:45.640
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:52.170
<i>You can open the gate!</i>

00:02:18.810 --> 00:02:20.780
Steel wall!

00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:29.120
If we don't hurry,
Sports Day will end!

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:32.150
Kaoru Punch!!

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:36.890
Now, it's my turn!

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:39.450
Explosive Panda Fireball!

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:44.700
Good! Let's go, Rurippe!

00:02:44.770 --> 00:02:45.700
Right!

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:51.140
Maiden's Prayer!

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:53.640
Reiko, not now!

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:07.420
Good grief...

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:09.760
Iron Wall!

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:16.770
Now! Ultra Cyclone Chopl!

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:24.570
Arrow of Light!

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:41.420
We did it!

00:03:41.890 --> 00:03:45.020
R- Reiko...

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:48.590
It's a victory of teamwork.

00:03:50.140 --> 00:03:54.770
Come, everyone! Let's return
to our enjoyable Sports Day.

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:57.710
Asagiri... you're a nuisance.

00:03:58.080 --> 00:03:59.700
Huh?

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:03.850
<i>You're a nuisance.</i>

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:09.250
I'm...

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:13.220
I'm a nuisance?!

00:04:19.930 --> 00:04:22.560
This, this...?

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:26.700
...this and this?

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:32.200
If l remember correctly, I bought
this during an emergency dispatch.

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:37.450
Can it be that I did
nothing but buy souvenirs...

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:40.210
...without actually fighting invaders?!

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:44.310
Come to think of it,
that could be true!

00:04:45.960 --> 00:04:49.120
Asagiri, everyone else
is already assembled.

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:50.190
Huh?

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:55.320
I told you today was the last practice day
of the independent volunteer activities.

00:04:55.400 --> 00:05:00.400
Oh, no! I- I'm sorry.
I'll go right now!

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:05.640
If only l could go to the ball, too...

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:09.010
Don't cry, Cinderella.

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:12.240
I will send you there.

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:13.980
Really?

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:19.360
Izzatti Puru-run Et-cafe Poom!

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:23.920
Oh. my!

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:29.370
Izzatti Puru-run Et-cafe Poom!

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:33.970
Oh, what a beautiful dress!

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:38.270
And so, Cinderella was able to
go to the ball at the castle.

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:40.630
Good! Everything is okay!

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:44.040
Get the scenery for the
ballroom scene, quick!

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:56.290
You were able to
make Cinderella happy...

00:05:56.360 --> 00:06:01.060
...but I make nothing but
mistakes with my gate magic.

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:04.070
So I hear.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:11.800
At this rate, I'll never be
the witch I wanted to be.

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:31.030
Are you all right, Reiko?

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:35.560
I- I'm fine. I want...

00:06:35.630 --> 00:06:40.000
...to be like you, Ruriko.

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:46.070
I want to fight
alongside everybody else.

00:06:46.480 --> 00:06:50.180
That's why I'm undergoing
intensive training.

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:52.110
What a waste of effort.

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:54.410
One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:06:59.090 --> 00:07:02.990
One, two!

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:05.030
Incompetent.

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:10.230
Just a minute, Reiko! Calm down!

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:20.440
Clown.

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:24.050
You want to know
how to use the Panda?

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:26.850
That's right.

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:30.850
I don't think it
will be very helpful.

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:35.620
My Explosive Panda Fireball
is an attack technique...

00:07:35.690 --> 00:07:39.060
...but your Maiden's Prayer
is an illusion technique.

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:44.130
Is that what it was?!

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:46.170
Burden.

00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:57.980
I really am good for nothing, after all.

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:08.350
It is sometimes wise to partake in
a cup of impure wine as diversion...

00:08:08.430 --> 00:08:11.360
...rather than to dwell
on the sour grapes.

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:13.530
<i>Partake?</i>

00:08:19.070 --> 00:08:21.970
Um, who are you?

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:27.200
Congratulations, Cinderella.
Please be happy.

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:32.710
I owe it all to you. Thank you,
sweet, gentle fairy godmother!

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:37.590
It wasn't me.
Your pure heart summoned me.

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:41.280
Never forget that.

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:42.220
Okay!

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:46.890
And so, Cinderella and the prince
lived happily ever after.

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:54.100
Wait, wait!

00:08:57.110 --> 00:09:00.040
Asagiri is really popular
with the children.

00:09:00.610 --> 00:09:04.550
Mentally, she's the same age
as them. They see things the same.

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:07.820
Oh, no! It's a puddle!

00:09:08.090 --> 00:09:11.320
Everybody, be careful!

00:09:13.160 --> 00:09:15.490
Are you okay, big sister Reiko?!

00:09:16.730 --> 00:09:19.490
I'm okay.

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:22.260
Yeesh, what are we to do with you?

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:26.190
Um, I'm sorry...

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:29.210
Well, you're funny,
so I'll forgive you!

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:32.000
I know, I'll let you
be my girlfriend!

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:36.510
G- G- G- Girl Friend?!

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:39.280
Hideki, you're so daring!

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:43.810
Shut up! Come on, let's go on
a date at the zoo tomorrow!

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:46.490
B- But...

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:49.890
ls that a key?

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:55.090
What, this? In my family,
both my dad and mom work.

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:01.270
<i>Well, see you later.</i>

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:05.510
<i>Be a good girl for Ms. Ono.</i>

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:09.210
<i>Come home soon.</i>

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:15.450
Hideki is a latchkey kid.

00:10:18.690 --> 00:10:21.180
Cool, huh?!

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:22.890
Yeah.

00:10:24.030 --> 00:10:26.030
Goodbye, Reiko!
Come again soon!

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:27.690
HI KARI DAYCARE
Goodbye, Reiko!
Come again soon!

00:10:27.930 --> 00:10:29.900
See you later!

00:10:30.300 --> 00:10:32.570
You were really impressive today.

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:38.370
I seem to get along with children.

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:43.640
Not that, I mean your puppet play.
The part of the witch was really good.

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:45.180
Huh?

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:52.050
When you use the puppets,
you give out ten times the energy.

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:56.950
Um... Thank you!

00:10:58.930 --> 00:11:04.630
Thank you, witch.
I think I can try harder now.

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:07.370
What are you doing?

00:11:07.440 --> 00:11:09.460
Coming!

00:11:10.510 --> 00:11:13.710
Oh... That's strange.

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:16.810
Where is the staff room?

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:23.380
I wonder if they
changed the wallpaper?

00:11:25.520 --> 00:11:27.490
Oh. my!

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:32.990
It's a big puppet!

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:46.970
Not again!

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:49.980
Oh, intense!

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:57.780
Hey! The gate robot!

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:00.290
Say What?!

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:03.060
We haven't received orders
to move out...

00:12:07.970 --> 00:12:09.760
What?

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:41.090
Oh, my.
How do I get out?

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:43.990
Oh?

00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:48.300
There's no use crying.
You should have held on tighter.

00:12:50.940 --> 00:12:53.640
<i>Here you go.</i>

00:12:53.980 --> 00:12:55.640
It's a robot!

00:12:56.050 --> 00:12:58.480
We all live in a...

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:12.490
Are you still unable to establish
contact with the gate robot?!

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:16.590
Sir, its radio seems
to be switched off.

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:22.740
Yes, who is it...?

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:28.940
<i>I'm home!</i>

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:32.070
A m-m-monsterous marionette!

00:13:35.590 --> 00:13:39.250
<i>Oh? Ms. Ono?</i>

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:43.460
A marionette...

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:50.030
<i>This is no good.
Ms. Ono was the only one I could depend on.</i>

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:55.370
I promised to meet
a friend at 4 o'clock, too...

00:13:57.170 --> 00:14:00.970
Hey, what are you doing
depending on others?!

00:14:01.050 --> 00:14:04.680
A good witch doesn't have
others do things for her...

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:07.680
...she does things for others.

00:14:08.090 --> 00:14:11.250
Just like how l made
Cinderella happy.

00:14:11.820 --> 00:14:19.090
Yes... That's why I wanted to be
like you ever since I was a child.

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:24.830
I wanted to make Papa
and Mama and Ms. Ono...

00:14:25.770 --> 00:14:30.900
...and all of my friends happy.

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:34.480
Monster!

00:14:39.180 --> 00:14:43.680
I think I've been too
dependent all this time.

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:51.490
Oh, my. Commander!

00:14:51.560 --> 00:14:53.430
Agent Asagiri!!

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:55.470
<i>Good afternoon.</i>

00:14:56.570 --> 00:15:02.470
Something must be done now.
Get out of the gate robot quickly.

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:06.480
That robot has been adjusted
exclusively for Ukiya's use.

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:09.610
<i>It is dangerous to be
operated by anyone except him!</i>

00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:17.010
Oh, no! I have to be somewherel!

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:19.650
What is wrong?!

00:15:19.720 --> 00:15:21.850
Apparently, the radio has
been switched off again.

00:15:22.260 --> 00:15:24.350
The gate robot has begun to move!

00:15:26.060 --> 00:15:28.030
Currently moving at 120 km per hour!

00:15:30.100 --> 00:15:33.090
HI MEYU RI ZOO
Welcome to the Kingdom of Animals!

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:37.870
Liar.

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:46.550
Holy crap! It's a robot!

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:54.150
Huh?

00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:59.660
<i>Hideki, !'m sorry! I'm late!</i>

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:02.530
Reiko?

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:04.830
<i>Why did you come in a robot?!</i>

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:11.070
Because I thought it looked
like a very large doll, but...

00:16:11.140 --> 00:16:16.170
<i>...when I got inside it,
I couldn't get out again.</i>

00:16:17.050 --> 00:16:18.910
Hmm...

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:26.280
Hideki!

00:16:31.230 --> 00:16:36.460
Oh, my. Did l just open it?

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:50.750
Reiko! Please give control
of the robot to me!

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:53.610
Um, well...

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:58.590
...l don't remember how
I opened it a moment ago!

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:03.420
<i>Reiko says she doesn't
know how to get out!</i>

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:05.490
A child is inside?!

00:17:05.560 --> 00:17:06.530
But how?!

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:08.160
Oh, brother.

00:17:09.230 --> 00:17:12.730
Reiko, please listen to me!
The switch to open the hatch...

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:15.730
...is 2nd from the right,
3rd from the top!

00:17:15.810 --> 00:17:17.770
Let's see...

00:17:18.740 --> 00:17:23.150
One, two from the right...

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:31.250
I'm Sorryl!

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:34.920
Everyone, open your gates!

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:37.290
Roger, AEGIS!

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:39.330
GATE...

00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:42.770
Don't tell me...!

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:44.700
This cage...

00:17:44.770 --> 00:17:46.740
...is an invader!!

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:56.570
I- I have to do something!

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:04.350
Reiko?

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:13.660
<i>To be a good witch...</i>

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:15.960
You can do it, Reiko!

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:19.300
<i>Ms. Ono was the only
one I could depend on.</i>

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:26.410
<i>...you must do things for others.</i>

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:30.280
<i>I think I've been too
dependent all this time.</i>

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:36.180
<i>You must do things for others.</i>

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:38.680
<i>I wanted to make
everybody happy.</i>

00:18:41.960 --> 00:18:44.050
<i>You must do things for others.</i>

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:45.960
Reiko!

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:51.030
I...

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:54.070
<i>You must do things for others.</i>

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:01.750
I'm going to become a witch!

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:08.440
Witches make people happy!

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:13.850
No invader will beat me!!

00:19:17.290 --> 00:19:18.690
Oh?

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:21.390
Asagiri, use this!

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:24.730
This is a special gate robot
device I had secretly developed...

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:26.930
...for just such an emergency.

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:43.840
This is the GR-O5-V!

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:49.290
Wow! It's a big piano!

00:19:49.490 --> 00:19:52.760
OPEN THE GATE!

00:19:54.800 --> 00:19:58.170
Maiden's Prayer!

00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:24.020
GATE OPEN!

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:27.830
Uh-oh.

00:20:28.630 --> 00:20:30.330
NOW!

00:20:35.840 --> 00:20:37.770
You did it, Rei...

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:39.570
ko?

00:20:56.090 --> 00:20:57.790
EXIT

00:21:35.630 --> 00:21:40.330
I'm so sorry, Hideki.
Because of me...

00:21:41.540 --> 00:21:45.670
...our date was ruined.

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:50.840
No, it wasn't!
You were cool, Reiko!

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:55.890
It's all thanks to this witch here.

00:21:55.950 --> 00:21:58.350
No, it isn't!
Huh?

00:21:58.820 --> 00:22:01.290
YOU'RE a witch, Reiko!

00:22:04.630 --> 00:22:06.930
Oh.

00:22:07.970 --> 00:22:10.160
Oh, yeah. You're right.

00:22:10.230 --> 00:22:13.500
Ayaya, you were incredible, Reiko!

00:22:13.570 --> 00:22:16.230
Really! Thank goodness
you were here.

00:22:16.310 --> 00:22:19.170
Perhaps it was the result
of your intensive training!

00:22:22.610 --> 00:22:26.810
Maybe, but she's still
not nearly as good as me.

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:40.490
<i>Itsumademo wasurenai
We received many things</i>

00:22:40.490 --> 00:22:44.360
<i>takusan no mono moratta ne.
we will never forget.</i>

00:22:44.460 --> 00:22:49.330
<i>Sora no iro utsushite hikaru
I don't mean the blue jewels flashing</i>

00:22:49.870 --> 00:22:52.710
<i>aoi houseki ya
with colors of the sky...</i>

00:22:52.710 --> 00:22:54.840
koinu-tachi
or a big yard

00:22:54.840 --> 00:23:00.010
<i>hanemawaru hiroi</i> niwaja <i>nai,
with puppies romping around,</i>

00:23:00.010 --> 00:23:03.350
motto motto daijina
but something <i>much</i> more

00:23:03.350 --> 00:23:07.980
<i>mono wo.
important.</i>

00:23:08.690 --> 00:23:12.850
<i>Kinou Kara kyou e
From yesterday to today,</i>

00:23:12.930 --> 00:23:17.490
<i>kyou kara asu e to
from today to tomorrow,</i>

00:23:17.960 --> 00:23:24.270
boku-tachi wa aruite yuku yo.
we will walk toward the future.
